  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ElasticsearchOASIS v2.0.2\n\nElasticsearch OASIS Provider — full-text search and analytics engine for OASIS holons and avatars via Elasticsearch REST API. Compatible with OpenSearch. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- Automate coordinated OASIS platform releases (7ed2053)\n- docs(packages): add missing NuGet guides and release setup sections (77c65ea)\n- feat(providers): add Qdrant, Weaviate, InfluxDB, TimescaleDB, Elasticsearch, DynamoDB, Couchbase, and Upstash OASIS storage providers (cfe1e42)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- fix(packaging): explicitly include newly documented package readmes (5be30be)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ElasticsearchOASIS",
